  "worked_solution": "If we denote our first number by $x$ and our second number by $y$, then we can write \"one-quarter of a number \" as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}x\n$$\n\nand \"three-sevenths of a second number\" as\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{7}y.\n$$\n\nSo, the whole sentence is \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}x-\\frac{3}{7}y.\n$$",
